<section class="info"><h2>Favicon ICO Generator</h2><p>Generate a standard <strong>favicon.ico</strong> containing multiple icon resolutions in one file. Everything is processed in your browser, so your source image does not need to be uploaded to a server.</p><h3>What you can create</h3><ul><li>ICO files from PNG, JPG, JPEG, WEBP, GIF or SVG images.</li><li>Emoji-based and text/letter favicons with live background, color, radius and padding controls.</li><li>One multi-size favicon.ico ready to place in your website root.</li></ul><div class="feature-row"><div class="feature"><strong>Multi-size ICO</strong><span>16px to 256px</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>Live Preview</strong><span>Changes update instantly</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>Private</strong><span>Browser-side processing</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>One Click</strong><span>Download favicon.ico</span></div></div><h3>How to use</h3><p>Choose an image, emoji or text, adjust the design, select the ICO sizes you need, then click <strong>Generate favicon.ico</strong>. Add the downloaded file to your site's root and use the provided HTML link tag.</p></section>
